    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1754402186\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenge of the Gamer is a third-person game that shows the gaming industry from the inside out. Remove the bad developers and get to the boss of the game company. You will visit many places that were previously inaccessible to regular players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/48e718ad9b457226c9f707a9dc17b2eb.poster.avif?t=1754402186\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/48e718ad9b457226c9f707a9dc17b2eb.webm?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/48e718ad9b457226c9f707a9dc17b2eb.mp4?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your sword and go on a journey filled with a multitude of battles and references. Your mission is to end the tyranny of big game companies and make games better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player is important to us. That\u2019s what the big gaming companies say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was created by one person and is actively developed. You can submit your idea in reviews or discussions on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Revenge of the Gamer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1754402186\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1754402186\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenge of the Gamer is a third-person game that shows the gaming industry from the inside out. Remove the bad developers and get to the boss of the game company. You will visit many places that were previously inaccessible to regular players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/48e718ad9b457226c9f707a9dc17b2eb.poster.avif?t=1754402186\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/48e718ad9b457226c9f707a9dc17b2eb.webm?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/48e718ad9b457226c9f707a9dc17b2eb.mp4?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your sword and go on a journey filled with a multitude of battles and references. Your mission is to end the tyranny of big game companies and make games better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player is important to us. That\u2019s what the big gaming companies say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was created by one person and is actively developed. You can submit your idea in reviews or discussions on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Revenge of the Gamer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1754402186\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1754402186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Demo version is available! This is a modern gaming company, and you are an unhappy player who came to leave your feedback. Grab your sword and go to the destruction of inept programmers, game designers and other developers. Revenge of the Gamer is a game about a modern gaming company.",
